## Application Architecture Identified

Reconnaissance identified several components relevant to the
application’s attack surface\.

### Frontend / Web Framework

Response metadata and application content identified **Next\.js** as the
web framework\.

### Authentication Provider

Authentication traffic identified **Supabase** as part of the
application’s authentication infrastructure\.

Observed authentication traffic followed the general structure:

```text
https://<project>.supabase.co/auth/v1/token
```

with password\-based authentication\.

These observations established the application’s authentication
architecture and informed subsequent access\-control testing\.

