# Next Assessment Phase

Testing will continue beyond page\-level authentication controls to
evaluate whether authorization is enforced by the underlying server\-side
functionality\.

The next assessment phase will focus on:

- Session handling
- Backend/API authorization
- Authenticated versus unauthenticated resource access
- Administrative functionality boundaries
- Application route exposure
- Input handling
- Security configuration
- Additional attack\-surface discovery

Any confirmed vulnerability will be documented with reproduction
evidence, impact analysis, severity, and remediation guidance\.

